# Protein-3 MADCIYYE - Protein N-lysine methyltransferase M (7OAT; X-ray; SAH + partner protein) - near substrate/SAM.  Open:  chimerax view.cxc
open protein_motif3_7OAT.pdb
set bgColor white
hide atoms
cartoon
color #1 #b0b0b0
color /B #d9b38c
show ligand
style ligand stick
color ligand byelement
color :0XU,NEA,QVR,SAH,SAM,SFG #b5651d
color :0XU,NEA,QVR,SAH,SAM,SFG byhetero
color /C:142-149 #238b45
show /C:142-149 atoms
style /C:142-149 stick
color /C:142-149 byhetero
hbonds /C:142-149 restrict /B | ligand reveal true color #303030 dashes 8 radius 0.05
2dlabel text "Protein-3 MADCIYYE - Protein N-lysine methyltransferase M (7OAT; X-ray; SAH + partner protein) - near substrate/SAM" xpos .03 ypos .04 size 14
lighting soft
graphics silhouettes true
view
